{"Cancelling scheduled emails loop is not robust - a failure to cancel a single email via SendGrid API causes the entire loop to abort, leaving the system in an inconsistent state where some emails may be cancelled with SendGrid but not removed from the database, and subsequent emails are not processed": 0.958757221698761, "Each reminder cancellation should be handled individually within a try...catch block to ensure a single failure does not affect processing of other reminders": 0.9203762412071228, "Errors should be logged using console.error instead of console.log for better visibility and to distinguish them from standard log messages": 0.4189961552619934}